Church Slavonic print recognition model for kraken (cu_synodal_v1)
Copyright 2026 Alexander Masenkov, Slovesitsa (https://slovesitsa.org)

Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

This model is a fine-tuned version of "PP-OCRv6 (medium) multilingual handwritten and
printed text recognition model" by Benjamin Kiessling,
https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21788410, Apache License 2.0.
The weights were changed by further training on Church Slavonic print (see README.md).

The training data includes line images and transcriptions from church-slavonic-ocr,
https://github.com/slavonic/church-slavonic-ocr, Copyright (c) 2026 Aleksandr Andreev, MIT License.
